hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1304","Bundar and Ya’qub bin Ibrahim told us: Yahya bin Sa’id told us, on the authority of Ibn Ajlan, on the authority of Amr bin Shuaib, on the authority of his father, On the authority of his grandfather, the Prophet, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him, “forbade buying and selling in the mosque, and the singing of poetry therein, and the seeking of lost things therein.” And about shaving on Friday before prayer.”"
